  "title": "Professor Seaglitch's Isle of Aural Decadence",
  "artist": "Libations & Oscillations",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>This mix represents the freshmen effort of Joe Noctum and Tonebreaker under the guise of Libations &amp; Oscillations. It wanders along at 70ish BPM while exploring the melodic yet gritty side of Glitch-Hop and Bass Music. It was originally performed at the Ambient Camp Out 35 as well as at the Moonmagnet Re-Union Party in Deep Ellum, Dallas. We hope you enjoy as much as we did constructing it.</p>",
